name: Dedupe refuses excess ledger input before inference and recovers through explicit options
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dedupe_input_bounds.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: options triage:dedupe
nav-mode:
keys: a Down
require-live-snap: 20 Key: maxLedgerObservations | observation-limit
ask: Does the advanced option distinguish ledger preparation from the number of candidates supplied to the model, with explicit limits and no promise of complete deduplication?
keys: Enter C-u
type: 1
keys: Enter
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/run-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dedupe_input_bounds.py @TMP_TARGET @ART blocked
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · failed | bounded-read-refused
expect: maxLedgerObservations
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 Outcome · failed | refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 Outcome · failed | refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 Outcome · failed | refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 Outcome · failed | refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 Outcome · failed | refusal-40x12
expect: Explicitly
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 15 No candidate pool | refusal-paged-40x12
ask: Is the read failure understandable through six sizes, with a visible limit correction, preserved findings and no model request or empty-success claim?
resize: 120x36
submit: options triage:dedupe
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Key: maxLedgerObservations | retained-limit
keys: Enter C-u
type: 4
keys: Enter
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/run-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dedupe_input_bounds.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
paste-file: @ART/completed-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · completed | bounded-proposal
expect: review before acceptance
expect: Confirmation attempts: 1
submit: relationships
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Proposed | retained-proposal
ask: Does explicit correction produce only a reviewable relationship, retaining all four observations and their verdicts, with two intercepted requests and bounded current-source confirmation and no automatic acceptance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · failed | recovered-refusal
expect: maxLedgerObservations
submit: relationships
require-live-snap: 25 Duplicate · Proposed | recovered-proposal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dedupe_input_bounds.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the failure and later proposal without another request, lost observations or a silent relationship decision?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
